OL,3,GNEWSAMan celebrates first bodybuilding
OL,4,Acontest win at 61
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 61-year-old man who won the first
OL,7,Fbodybuilding competition he entered is
OL,8,Furging others not to define themselves
OL,9,Fby their age.
OL,11,FIan Fox, from Selsey in West Sussex,
OL,12,Fsaid he had always kept in shape but
OL,13,Fwas encouraged to enter a bodybuilding
OL,14,Fcompetition after he started training
OL,15,Fat Imperium Strength Fitness in
OL,16,FChichester earlier this year.
OL,18,FHe then won the over 50s category at
OL,19,Fthe PCA First Timers event in Derby
OL,20,Flast weekend, earning an invitation to
OL,21,Fthe world championships in Seville
OL,22,Flater this week.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
