OL,3,GNEWSAMan celebrates first bodybuilding
OL,4,Acontest win at 61
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told BBC Radio Derby: "You are what
OL,7,Fyou think, and whatever you think, you
OL,8,Fbecome."
